{"availability":"available","full":"jecinthacodes/student-portal","name":"student-portal","description":"EduFlow — a student portal for UNICROSS CSC 1/4 (Class of 2026). Login, class schedule, announcements, class rep info, and semester roadmap in one place. Student portal for UNICROSS Computer Science, CSC 1/4 — schedule, announcements & class rep info.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-12T00:36:36Z","updated":"2026-09-01T13:20:05Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jecinthacodes.github.io/student-portal/","topics":["computer-science","computer-science-project","github-pages","html-css-js","html-css-js-project","student-portal","student-portal-system","webapp","webapplication"],"demo":"https://jecinthacodes.github.io/student-portal/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.701Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.701Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.701Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.701Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A single-page student portal built for the University of Cross River State (UNICROSS) Computer Science Class of 2026, Set 1/4.","Live demo: jecinthacodes.github.io/student-portal","EduFlow is a front-end web application designed to centralize the everyday information a first-year Computer Science class needs to stay coordinated: class schedules, announcements, class representative contacts, and a bird's-eye view of the four-year degree programme. It was built to replace the scattered mix of WhatsApp broadcasts, printed timetables, and word-of-mouth updates that most Nigerian university classes rely on, by giving CSC 1/4 a single, always-available reference point."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jecinthacodes/student-portal/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2bacdc3965ea2b78478a051bbab27f3ce3ec0c96dcccbc681a1ad894cc693aba","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.801Z"},"overviewChe